<metadata><name>Snowlands 1818 Sagehen Peak and Crooked Peak</name><desc>out and back to waypoint 6; side trip from waypoint 5 to 7. 7.6 miles round trip (add 0.8 mile round trip if you ascend both peaks). Line traced from Marcus Libkind's map, tours.snowlands.org/tours/18/1818_tour.htm</desc></metadata>
<wpt lat="37.890648" lon="-118.865222"><ele>2476.74</ele><name>1818-01 trailhead</name></wpt>
